## Primary Request and Intent
What the user is trying to achieve, in their own terms. Include the wording of any
requirement that constrains how the work may be done, and any correction the user gave
about your approach.

## Key Technical Concepts
The languages, frameworks, libraries, commands, patterns and domain rules the work
